# The gallery pass: the Workshop images, taken on Nelim's sanctuary ("Nelims-tribe"). Only 14-publication-shots.feature asks for it, and it is
# skipped in every other pass, so this map is only for that feature:
#   Submit-PickleRun.ps1 -Mod WorkStudio -DepMap wsl-deps.gallery.map -Filter "14-publication-shots" -Language English
# Run it in English: the Workshop page is English.
#
# Since 2026-10-08 the sanctuary has a repository of its own, SanctuaryBacklot (docs/GALERIE.md there). This map is its
# Tests/Pickle/wsl-deps.sanctuary.map (minimum mod list, same order) plus what this mod's own steps use. Two tools, two prefixes in the feature:
#   - `Nelim's Sanctuary: ...`     the places of the sanctuary (SB, SanctuaryBacklot/docs/steps.md)
#   - `Nelim's Pickle Tools: ...`  everything else (NPT, PickleTools/docs/steps.md): camera, decor, colonists, animals, clear screen, screenshot mode
# The fixture "Nelims-tribe" now lives in SanctuaryBacklot/Mod: never stage it from ScreenshotStudio as well (Pickle fails on two fixtures of that name).
# The file name is the name of the seed folder, Tests/Pickle/config/gallery/ (AB's settings, Venus Touch's).

# The sanctuary itself: fixture and place steps.
nelim.sanctuarybacklot path:SanctuaryBacklot/Mod
# What the sanctuary's own suite stages (copied from SanctuaryBacklot's map).
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.camerazoom path:PickleTools/CameraZoom/Mod
nelim.pickletools.stagedecor path:PickleTools/StageDecor/Mod
nelim.pickletools.coatsteps path:PickleTools/CoatSteps/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
# The bundle is committed under PickleTools/Mod: this shell replaces it, so the tools above are the only copy of their steps (see StandaloneBase).
nelim.pickletools   path:PickleTools/Tests/Pickle/StandaloneBase/Mod
# What this mod's own steps and the feature use: click diagnostics, the game's screenshot mode, "stands at ... facing" and "carries the item".
nelim.pickletools.clickdiagnostics   path:PickleTools/ClickDiagnostics/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode     path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.colonistrace       path:PickleTools/ColonistRace/Mod

# Bodies and trousers, as the sanctuary's minimum list has them. Female Body Variants and Female Apparel Variants load BEFORE WDI (else their
# Naked_*_Female textures shadow WDI's); AB's Visible Pants is indispensable (without it Venus does nothing). Seeds: config/gallery/.
tiagocc0.FemaleBodyVariants 3798082132
tiagocc0.FemaleApparelVariants 3799726535
wdi.realistic.bodies 3527486510
ab.vplrf 2986402536
nelim.venustouch.waistlines path:VenusTouchWaistlines/Mod
# Facial animation: base, experimentals, Vanilla Textures Expanded, Akeron Extras (needs VTE), EyeGenes3 (Nelim's brown eyes), the performance patch, then VFAE.
Nals.FacialAnimation 1635901197
nals.facialanimationexperimentals 2581693737
VanillaExpanded.VTEXE.FacialAnims 2816938779
Newton.AKNExtras.FacialAnimations 2889716301
lucius.eyegenes3 3745223213
astryl.FacialAnimationPerformancePatch 3790129900
sd.fa.movingvanillaeyes 3753978140
